  "body": "What happens: the post-merge batch gate is red on main `3e47b898b`.\nRun: https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/actions/runs/44197913211\nFailed step: \"Batch gate tier\", 1 failed of 842 steps, wall 48.7 min.\nFailure: motion suite `adaptive_entry_pieces`, test\n`a_narrow_second_piece_names_its_ramp_stand_in_at_each_level` (FAIL in 19 s).\n\nContext: the last five merges to main are the batch `89be78cd2..3e47b898b`\n(#2008, #2376, #2412, #2383 adaptive outside-stock, #2387 cycle dwell).\n#2383 changed adaptive clearing stock (`boundary.rs`, `Family::Clearing`\nwith `Containment::Outside`) and is the prime suspect for an\nadaptive-entry-piece regression.\n\nNote: the workflow's report job did not open this issue - the known\nbug #1611 (report job skipped when the gate fails). This issue is filed\nby hand for that reason.\n\nDone means: a green post-merge run on a later main head.\n",
